 "title": "【毎秒1.7億トンの水壁】なぜドレーク海峡は世界屈指の危険な海域なのか？【ゆっくり解説】",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZLof9ddmukQ/maxresdefault.jpg",
 "description": "毎秒1億トン以上の水が流れ、20m級の巨大波が襲うドレーク海峡。南極周極流と偏西風が生み出す世界屈指の危険海域は、なぜ多くの船乗りを飲み込んできたのか？そして現代でも商船が避ける理由とは？\n\n参考\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iuMKDbtjFyQ\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gt0hA5E7aT4\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0coHreGYgo\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gdjLxqR5Q6s\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3-bA_uT4tEQ\n\nNew Estimates of Continental Discharge and Oceanic Freshwater Transport\nhttps://ams.confex.com/ams/pdfpapers/55037.pdf\n\nMorphological and geological features of\nDrake Passage, Antarctica, from a new digital\nbathymetric model\nhttps://nora.nerc.ac.uk/id/eprint/520136/1/Morphological%20and%20geological%20features%20of%20Drake%20Passage%20Antarctica%20from%20a%20new%20digital%20bathymetric%20model.pdf\n\n\nエンデュアランス号漂流記\nアーネスト・シャクルトン著　木村義晶/谷口善也訳/中央文庫\n\n▼シャクルトンに興味があったらぜひ！\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgh_77TtX5I\n\nAnales del Instituto de la Patagonia\nhttps://www.scielo.cl/scielo.php?pid=S0718-686X2020000300045&script=sci_arttext\n\nWhy the Drake Passage is one of the most dangerous—and important—places on Earth\nhttps://www.nationalgeographic.com/environment/article/drake-passage-antarctica-dangerous-waters\n\nSustained monitoring of the Southern Ocean at Drake Passage: past achievements and future priorities\nhttps://nora.nerc.ac.uk/id/eprint/16227/1/Meredith.pdf\n\n\nThe expedition around of the world of Willem Schouten and Jacob le Maire\nhttps://www.atlasofmutualheritage.nl/page/10936/the-expedition-around-of-the-world-of-willem-schouten-and-jacob-le\n\nREVISED GUIDELINES FOR FORMAL SAFETY ASSESSMENT (FSA)\nFOR USE IN THE IMO RULE-MAKING PROCESS\nhttps://wwwcdn.imo.org/localresources/en/OurWork/HumanElement/Documents/MSC-MEPC.2-Circ.12-Rev.2%20-%20Revised%20Guidelines%20For%20Formal%20Safety%20Assessment%20%28Fsa%29For%20Use%20In%20The%20Imo%20Rule-Making%20Proces...%20%28Secretariat%29.pdf\n\nWeb alert: Magellan Strait Pilotage - is it compulsory or not and who pays for the pilotage fees?\nhttps://north-standard.com/insights-and-resources/resources/archive/articles/web-alert-magellan-strait-pilotage-is-it-compulsory-or-not-and-who-pays-for-the-pilotage-fees-286\n\nNavigation of the James Caird on the Shackleton Expedition\nhttps://cms.canterburymuseum.com/assets/Navigation-of-the-James-Caird-on-the-Shackleton-Expedition.pdf\n\nHumpback whale movements in a narrow and heavily-used shipping passage, Chile \nhttps://whalesound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/16-1.Humpback-whale-movements-in-a-narrow-and-heavily-used-shipping-passage-Chile.pdf\n\nBIMCO Laytime Definitions 2013\nhttps://www.bimco.org/media/qy2neqim/laytime-definitions-for-charter-parties-2013-v2.pdf\n\nBaltic Code 2020\nhttps://www.balticexchange.com/en/data-services/Documentation.html\n\nWeather-Routing System Based on METOC Navigation Risk Assessment\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/2077-1312/7/5/127\n\nReport on marine casualty involving the cruise ship ‘Viking Polaris’ south-east of Cape Horn, 29 November 2022\nhttps://nsia.no/Marine/Published-reports/2023-06\n\nHumpback whale movements in a narrow and heavily-used shipping\npassage, Chile \nhttps://whalesound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/16-1.Humpback-whale-movements-in-a-narrow-and-heavily-used-shipping-passage-Chile.pdf\n\nIAATO Overview of Antarctic Vessel Tourism:The 2023-24 Season, and Preliminary\nhttps://iaato.org/system/files/2025-01/ATCM46_ip102_rev1_e_IAATO-Overview-of-Antarctic-Vessel-Tourism-The-2023-24-Season-and-Preliminary-Estimates-for-2024-25.pdf\n\n\nAntarctic Search and Rescue (SAR) Workshop 5\nImproving SAR Coordination and Response in the Antarctic\nhttps://static1.squarespace.com/static/61073506e9b0073c7eaaf464/t/64dd62fcea87622be9014724/1692230400026/SAR%2BWorkshop%2B5%2B2023%2BFinal%2BReport.pdf\n\nhttps://www.latitude.aq/maps/pdf/aqmap_comnap_sar_2008-08-13.pdf\n\n\n【お知らせ】メンバーシップを開始しました！\nいつも応援ありがとうございます。\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\